  problem \\(X = \mathrm{argmin}_{Z \in \Re^{n \times k}} ||A Z - B||_F^2 +
  \lambda ||Z||_F^2\\). If \\(m \lt n\\) then `output` is computed as
  \\(X = A^T (A A^T + \lambda I)^{-1} B\\), which (for \\(\lambda = 0\\)) is
